  "fullDescription": "This elegant watercolor floral clipart set features soft blue, beige, and neutral rose illustrations with delicate botanical leaves. Designed in a timeless, airy style, these florals are perfect for wedding stationery, invitations, branding, wall art, scrapbooking, and digital design projects.\nThe collection includes individual flowers, leafy branches, and beautifully arranged floral bouquets, making it easy to create your own compositions. Each element is hand-painted style artwork and saved as high-resolution PNG files with transparent backgrounds for effortless layering.\n\nWhat’s included:\n\n31 Individual watercolor roses and leaves elements.\n6 bouquets.\n\nPerfect for weddings, baby showers, feminine branding, social media graphics, planners, cards, and printables.\n\nHappy Designing!\nSumi Serene",
